[b]v1.2.0 — Limbs, bosses, streaks (68 achievements)[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Severed limbs[/b] counted per character and for the squad, shown in the F6 panel. Suggested by az455862.
[*][b]Boss achievements[/b]: defeat (kill or knock out) the Dust King, the Bugmaster, Holy Lord Phoenix, Emperor Tengu, Tinfist and more.
[*][b]Kill streaks[/b]: 3 kills in 30 seconds, 5 in a minute, 10 takedowns in a minute. Uses game time, so pausing doesn't count.
[*][b]Stealth knockouts[/b] counted on their own, with their own achievements.
[*][b]F6 panel[/b]: achievements grouped by category with a completion %, your most frequent victims, and the mod version in the title.
[*]23 new achievements, 68 in total. New metrics for your own achievements: limbs, char_limbs, stealth_kos, char_stealth_kos, npc_kills / npc_kos / npc_takedowns, burst_kills / burst_takedowns.
[/list]
Existing progress is kept. If you edited achievements.txt, merge your changes into the new file. Requires RE_Kenshi v0.3.5+. Full changelog: [url=https://github.com/LucasSKrewer/kenshi-achievements/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md]GitHub[/url]
